  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\frac{{ }^7 \\mathrm{C}_2+{ }^6 \\mathrm{C}_2-{ }^3 \\mathrm{C}_1}{{ }^{10} \\mathrm{C}_3}=\\frac{33}{120}=\\frac{11}{40}$"
